{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-L4-phone-tracker-data-01","date":"2026-11-20","lens":"4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-data","refs":["F-phone-1023","F-phone-1022","F-phone-1011","F-phone-1009"],"severity":"S4","title":"Erase all data leaves four workout settings behind on the phone","what":"Erase all data is meant to leave the phone like a fresh install, and the privacy notice says it removes everything the app holds on the phone. It resets the main workout settings, but four smaller saved choices stay: the gym's plates and bar setup, the muscle tip choices (snoozed or skipped muscles), the rest alert choices and which routine folders are open. None of them holds a name, a workout or a photo, so the next person to use the phone only inherits these choices.","expected":"Erase all data resets every saved choice of the workout part of the app, so nothing of the last person is left.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/onboarding/eraseDevice.ts:190-201","apps/mobile/src/tracker/store/plateSetupStore.ts:34","apps/mobile/src/tracker/store/muscleTipsStore.ts:82","apps/mobile/src/tracker/store/restAlertPrefsStore.ts:48","apps/mobile/src/tracker/store/folderOpenStore.ts:30","apps/dashboard/public/privacy.html:201"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"erase-skips-small-tracker-settings","who":"members who erase the app to hand the phone on","how_often":"every Erase all data","fix_line":"Add the four saved choices to the settings reset that Erase all data already runs.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
